      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا عَلَيْهِ جُذَّةٌ</span></b>  <i>There is not upon him a piece of
rag;</i> i. e., <i>any garment to cover him:</i> (L:) or
<i>anything</i> (S, L, K) <i>of clothing:</i> (S, L:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُذَذٌ</span>.
(Bd in xxi. 59.)

